  "ruleText": "Elec 103.03 Staff. The office of professional licensure and certification shall perform the record-keeping and other statutory functions of the board and to oversee the board’s day-to-day operations.\n\nSource. #10354, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13; ss by #10421, eff 9-25-13, EXPIRED: 7-1-16 pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II and 2015, 276:45 and 276:57\n\nNew. #12202, eff 6-7-17",
